{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>you shall not deal falsely</b>: on account of the stranger, like the meaning of 'you shall judge righteously between a man and his brother and his stranger' [Deuteronomy 1:16]. So too in measure, that you shall not commit fraud in the measures of the nations — also the measures of the nations change. And it is possible that the meaning is: 'according to the known mishpat [judgment] in the land.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:13.005416235Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}